                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "34729c66-dfa4-35d4-8d9a-c071cf703979",
                        "entry_id": "c58f8a25-07b4-360b-a297-4e1caa5a2664",
                        "glosses": [
                            "verantwoordelijk voor een laakbaar/strafbaar feit"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf9c8f58-5c36-4c9d-bcba-515d72f619d0",
                                "sense_id": "34729c66-dfa4-35d4-8d9a-c071cf703979",
                                "text": "Hij was schuldig aan deze vreselijke moord."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1067eb5d-cfca-3ae2-8ee2-231645b83c5d",
                        "entry_id": "c58f8a25-07b4-360b-a297-4e1caa5a2664",
                        "glosses": [
                            "verschuldigd"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "56a28ffb-2f2a-4cb2-95ed-a9d82fd63109",
                                "sense_id": "1067eb5d-cfca-3ae2-8ee2-231645b83c5d",
                                "text": "U blijft dat bedrag schuldig."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4b59312-6cfa-353e-9327-28ed62a63f9a",
                        "entry_id": "c58f8a25-07b4-360b-a297-4e1caa5a2664",
                        "glosses": [
                            "verplicht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc452fd3-7ed1-4509-b417-76a089a256f2",
                                "sense_id": "f4b59312-6cfa-353e-9327-28ed62a63f9a",
                                "text": "Dat een iegelijk schuldig is zich bij de ware Kerk te voegen"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "8c8403a7-3f3a-3730-a188-8cb24d7db32f",
                "word": "schuldig",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b43b6d6-645c-3153-8128-6f41df4b0f85",
                        "entry_id": "8c8403a7-3f3a-3730-a188-8cb24d7db32f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "verantwoordelijk voor een laakbaar/strafbaar feit"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e174acc-6672-40c7-a3ae-5bcd89afee60",
                                "sense_id": "6b43b6d6-645c-3153-8128-6f41df4b0f85",
                                "text": "Hoewel ik als vader niet veel had kunnen doen, aangezien ze dit proces vooral met haar vriendinnen verwerkte, voelde ik me toch schuldig dat ik er niet voor haar was op dit indrukwekkende moment in haar jonge leven."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d3e823b-76fc-4b8d-9405-515e6e9d3f7a",
                                "sense_id": "6b43b6d6-645c-3153-8128-6f41df4b0f85",
                                "text": "Daar voel ik me ook schuldig over, maar als er iets is belt hij zijn vader, niet mij."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00e2c2ed-2107-4be6-91a8-d99a00329849",
                                "sense_id": "6b43b6d6-645c-3153-8128-6f41df4b0f85",
                                "text": "Heeft Hannah een punt? En wat als Jos wél wist wat hij deed en dacht dat het ooit zou uitkomen? Of erger nog: wat als ik dat stiekem ook onbewust heb geweten? Ben ik dan schuldig aan zijn schuld? En wat betekent dat? Dat het pact dat we ooit sloten ons allebei gevangen heeft gezet? En dat hij er wel uit móést breken? 'Lot, verraad is pas verraad als het moedwillig gebeurt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6699825-e2cc-40d8-ae8b-64c5144b6678",
                                "sense_id": "6b43b6d6-645c-3153-8128-6f41df4b0f85",
                                "text": "Door zijn ontsnappingspoging zal hij bij voorbaat al schuldig lijken."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf4e6053-0427-4840-96cc-100414f283df",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c8403a7-3f3a-3730-a188-8cb24d7db32f",
                        "source_sense_id": "6b43b6d6-645c-3153-8128-6f41df4b0f85",
                        "target_lang_word": "guilty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "guilty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb099df4-95ba-3e85-b689-43d40fcf4268",
                                        "entry_id": "97e1e200-0d35-3710-ae25-de8fb0c1514b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Responsible for a dishonest act."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf664220-8083-4d39-ac96-84fed3737ad0",
                                                "sense_id": "fb099df4-95ba-3e85-b689-43d40fcf4268",
                                                "text": "He was guilty of cheating at cards."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a426954-375f-3046-8199-8405964444cf",
                                        "entry_id": "97e1e200-0d35-3710-ae25-de8fb0c1514b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Judged to have committed a crime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23052881-f917-43b8-95d1-2b1ad34dd3bb",
                                                "sense_id": "1a426954-375f-3046-8199-8405964444cf",
                                                "text": "The guilty man was led away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0a88804-7ec4-3301-9bc6-16f701b8faf8",
                                        "entry_id": "97e1e200-0d35-3710-ae25-de8fb0c1514b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a sense of guilt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75b62d2f-0692-45d5-8f36-088bbe708bc8",
                                                "sense_id": "e0a88804-7ec4-3301-9bc6-16f701b8faf8",
                                                "text": "Do you have a guilty conscience?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67ac8eb0-a81b-4648-bea0-4dcb53a90598",
                                                "sense_id": "e0a88804-7ec4-3301-9bc6-16f701b8faf8",
                                                "text": "I corralled the judge, and we started off across the fields, in no very mild state of fear of that gentleman's wife, whose vigilance was seldom relaxed. And thus we came by a circuitous route to Mohair, the judge occupied by his own guilty thoughts, and I by others not less disturbing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53aec102-7eb4-44ed-9193-bf0f9731f5c0",
                                                "sense_id": "e0a88804-7ec4-3301-9bc6-16f701b8faf8",
                                                "text": "The numbers thin out the further we get from London, so I don't feel guilty when I remove my mask momentarily to scoff some of the snacks I'd bought at Marylebone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3f3f27b-637d-3a26-aec1-496fada741df",
                                        "entry_id": "97e1e200-0d35-3710-ae25-de8fb0c1514b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Blameworthy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaeccf95-24ab-402d-bf06-6ceba3ac2941",
                                                "sense_id": "a3f3f27b-637d-3a26-aec1-496fada741df",
                                                "text": "I have a guilty secret."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "198741cc-02db-4759-b7a7-d83e91248ac2",
                                                "sense_id": "a3f3f27b-637d-3a26-aec1-496fada741df",
                                                "text": "Don’t you see that we have been playing a guilty game, and have been overreached […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e016fb9d-d1d9-4aee-aff2-858b66ec4c5c",
                                                "sense_id": "a3f3f27b-637d-3a26-aec1-496fada741df",
                                                "text": "At twilight in the summerv[…] the mice come out. Theyv[…]veat the luncheon crumbs. Mr. Checkly, for instance, always brought his dinner in a paper parcel in his coat-tail pocket, and ate it when so disposed, sprinkling crumbs lavishly—the only lavishment of which he was ever guilty—on the floor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "guilty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae6cd07d-35e4-30a5-8d50-9179a36d9fd1",
                                        "entry_id": "a70a4d07-7861-34b6-8b01-e5f709628926",
                                        "glosses": [
